msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCMODE.NAME"
msgid "1. GC Mode"
msgstr "1. GC 方式"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCMODE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Manual: this mod holds off managed collection and releases it on the timer set below (recommended).\nAuto: no intervention at all - the game manages GC by itself. Lower heap peak, but collections happen more often and stutter more; suited to low-memory machines.\nOptions 2 and 3 have no effect when Auto is selected. Changing this requires a game restart."
msgstr "手动：由模组按住托管回收，按第 2 项定时放行（推荐）。\n自动：完全不干预，交给游戏自己管理——堆峰值更低，但回收更频繁、卡顿次数更多，适合低内存机器。\n选「自动」时第 2、3 项无效。改动需重启游戏。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCMODE.MANUAL"
msgid "Manual (mod-managed, recommended)"
msgstr "手动（模组接管回收，推荐）"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCMODE.AUTO"
msgid "Auto (game-managed)"
msgstr "自动（交给游戏管理）"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCRELEASEMINUTES.NAME"
msgid "2. GC Release Interval (minutes)"
msgstr "2. GC 回收时间（分钟）"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.GCRELEASEMINUTES.TOOLTIP"
msgid "1-20 minutes. Shorter: lower heap and smaller pauses, but more of them.\nLonger: fewer pauses, but each one is larger. No effect when Auto is selected."
msgstr "1-20 分钟。间隔越短：堆越低、单次停顿越小，但停顿次数越多。\n间隔越长：次数少，但单次停顿更大。选「自动」时此项无效。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.COLLECTAFTERSAVE.NAME"
msgid "3. Collect GC After Saving"
msgstr "3. 存档后回收 GC"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.COLLECTAFTERSAVE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Off: skip the game's own GC.Collect() at the end of every save, which keeps the save window short (recommended).\nOn: allow it - a cleaner heap, but one extra pause after each save. No effect when Auto is selected."
msgstr "关：跳过游戏在每次存档结束后自带的 GC.Collect()，存档窗口因此更短（推荐）。\n开：允许它在存档后回收，堆更干净但每次存档后多一次停顿。选「自动」时此项无效。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.REALSCREENSHOT.NAME"
msgid "4. Real Screenshot"
msgstr "4. 真实截图"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.REALSCREENSHOT.TOOLTIP"
msgid "On: re-render the preview image on every save, so it is always up to date (about 0.45 s each).\nOff: render once on the first save of the session and copy it for the rest (recommended default)."
msgstr "开：每次存档都重新渲染预览图（预览图永远最新，每次约多花 0.45 秒）。\n关：本局只在首次存档时渲染一张，之后所有存档直接复制它（推荐的默认值）。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.VERBOSE.NAME"
msgid "5. Diagnostic Log"
msgstr "5. 诊断日志"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BETTERSAVE.OPTIONS.VERBOSE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "For developer use."
msgstr "供开发者使用。"
